### Request 6-digit OTP Code for Patient Phone (10min TTL in Redis)
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
POST http://localhost:8000/api/tenant/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

{
    "phone": "+5511999990001"
}

###

### Verify OTP Code and Generate Scoped Sanctum Access Token
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
# @prompt otpCode The 6-digit OTP code received
POST http://localhost:8000/api/tenant/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

{
    "phone": "+5511999990001",
    "code": "{{otpCode}}"
}

###

### Get Patient Profile with Bearer Sanctum Token
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
# @prompt accessToken The Bearer token issued upon OTP verification
GET http://localhost:8000/api/tenant/auth/me
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Inspect Fast Action Token Details (Self-service Portal Pre-check)
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
# @prompt token The 64-char raw action token
GET http://localhost:8000/api/tenant/tokens/{{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### Consume Fast Action Token (1-Click Appointment Confirmation)
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
# @prompt token The 64-char raw action token
POST http://localhost:8000/api/tenant/tokens/{{token}}/consume
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

{
    "expected_action": "CONFIRMATION"
}
